#. module: barcodes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:barcodes.view_barcode_nomenclature_form
msgid ""
"Patterns can also define how numerical values, such as weight or price, can be\n"
"                                encoded into the barcode. They are indicated by <code>{NNN}</code> where the N's\n"
"                                define where the number's digits are encoded. Floats are also supported with the \n"
"                                decimals indicated with D's, such as <code>{NNNDD}</code>. In these cases, \n"
"                                the barcode field on the associated records <i>must</i> show these digits as \n"
"                                zeroes."
msgstr ""
"Ereduek zenbakizko balioak (adibidez, pisua edo prezioa) nola kodetzen diren ere\n"
"                                defini dezakete barra-kodean. <code>{NNN}</code> kodearekin adierazten dira; N hizkiek zenbakiak zein posiziotan kodetzen diren zehazten dute. Zenbaki errealak ere onesten dira, \n"
"                                dezimalak D hizkiarekin adierazten badira; adibidez, <code>{NNNDD}</code>. \n"
"                                Kasu horietan, erlazionatutako erregistroetako barra-kodearen eremuak zeroak <i>eduki behar ditu</i> posizio \n"
"                                horietan."

